      "description": "🏡🏡Welcome IHOMEI Brand Store!🏡🏡\n\nFollow us for more happening deals!\n\n✅【All goods are Philippine Ready Stock and 100% authentic】 \n✅【We ship within 24 hours (Working-day ONLY)】\n✅【Wish you having a pleasant shopping experience】\n\n---Professional Barber Clippers: These top-quality clippers are designed for professional barbers, ensuring precise and effortless haircuts every time. \n---Washable Blade: The blades of these electric clippers are easily detachable and washable, allowing for easy cleaning and maintenance.\n--- LED Display Screen: Equipped with an led display screen, these clippers provide real-time information on battery life and cutting speed, ensuring a convenient and efficient hair cutting experience. \n---Strong Power and Long Lasting: With a powerful motor, these clippers deliver consistent and reliable performance, making them suitable for both quick trims and longer haircuts. The rechargeable battery ensures long-lasting usage, eliminating the need for frequent charging. \n---Versatile Usage: Whether you're a professional barber, a stylist, or simply want to maintain your hair at home, these clippers are perfect for all your haircutting and beard shaving needs. They also make an ideal gift for Father's Day or Christmas.\n\n\n\n\nNOTICE：\n1. Due to the light of the photo and the difference between the monitors, there may be a certain color difference between the actual object and the picture.\n2.  Please allow a slight size difference，due to manual measurement. but it does not affect the use.\nBUYER NOTICE: \nWhen You received goods, if the products broken or not satisfy with it, please Contact with us, Thank you!",
