          "img_id": null,
          "description_type": 1,
          "empty_paragraph_count": 1
        },
        {
          "text": "---Professional Barber Clippers: These top-quality clippers are designed for professional barbers, ensuring precise and effortless haircuts every time. ",
          "type": 0,
          "ratio": null,
          "img_id": null,
          "description_type": 1,
          "empty_paragraph_count": null
        },
        {
          "text": "---Washable Blade: The blades of these electric clippers are easily detachable and washable, allowing for easy cleaning and maintenance.",
          "type": 0,
          "ratio": null,
          "img_id": null,
          "description_type": 1,
          "empty_paragraph_count": null
        },
        {
          "text": "--- LED Display Screen: Equipped with an led display screen, these clippers provide real-time information on battery life and cutting speed, ensuring a convenient and efficient hair cutting experience. ",
          "type": 0,
          "ratio": null,
          "img_id": null,
          "description_type": 1,
          "empty_paragraph_count": null
        },
        {
          "text": "---Strong Power and Long Lasting: With a powerful motor, these clippers deliver consistent and reliable performance, making them suitable for both quick trims and longer haircuts. The rechargeable battery ensures long-lasting usage, eliminating the need for frequent charging. ",
          "type": 0,
          "ratio": null,
          "img_id": null,
          "description_type": 1,
          "empty_paragraph_count": null
        },
        {
          "text": "---Versatile Usage: Whether you're a professional barber, a stylist, or simply want to maintain your hair at home, these clippers are perfect for all your haircutting and beard shaving needs. They also make an ideal gift for Father's Day or Christmas.",
          "type": 0,
